{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_04_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_04","title":"海洋","storyCode":"SV-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"931829ede08887054ffa95004e7f49138e41d6e4d9e97b63159c82d9dab344d4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"退下。你不是她的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"退下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，強很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該踏入這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"違背規則，就要付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我管不了那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你會留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想和你打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。邪惡的阿戈爾人，你一定是害怕了！有長官在，你絕對跑不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，如果這是必須的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）我將打敗你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"好快，竟比剛才和我交手時候還要快許多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣的速度，我根本就連她的裙擺都打不中......她到底還藏了多少？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"攻擊和閃避都越來越快，老師也是。我就要跟不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"原來我......我還差這麼多？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這不行。那可是一個阿戈爾人。我才不能輸給阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這個阿戈爾人，她好像，還在拿著她的箱子當武器......那箱子是什麼做的啊！為什麼那麼硬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，老師也沒有用手炮。要是用上的話......瞬間就能把她拿下吧？連著這條街一起，都會一起被轟成渣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"然而......那只是一個阿戈爾人啊？她的模樣，和那些怪物並不一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她用的是......某種法術嗎？我感覺不出來。我們的燈......也並沒有能壓制她的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——這阿戈爾人身上藏著的秘密太多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！您果然贏了。我就知道，任何人都無法撼動您分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那個阿戈爾人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？這......怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"她受傷了，跑不了多遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你打不過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......但絕不能讓她這樣的人在這片海岸恣意行走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"看方向，她應該是去居民聚居處了。她可能混入人群，當地居民之中有人在幫她。我會一間一間屋子找過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你認為這是對的，你就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，這座城市的異狀，是她帶來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你去看。你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市裡的人，他們的行為很不正常。每天就像沒有醒著的時候。他們行動，卻不是為了到達。他們進食，甚至不是為了飽腹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他們正在往海裡走，而且他們並不認為這是自殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你制止了他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是。因為這顯然是錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我們關心的，是結果。你認為你的糾正能有對的結果，那就去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"對的結果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"若不能，那你必須有所選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"判官——你的雙眼，你的劍，需緊盯伊比利亞最大的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是，長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"最大的威脅......是那些正在上岸的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，這些正在走向大海的人，他們與這些怪物有什麼聯繫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"對......一定有聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"老師說過，異常往往不是單一現象。這些恐怖的異象之間，必有關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"要解決問題——你首先要看清問題所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——是那些躲在暗中謀劃一切的阿戈爾人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他們潛伏在岸上，躲藏在我們律法的縫隙裡，腐化我們城市的皮肉，動搖我們同胞的心志，試圖侵蝕我們國家的筋骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"在他們的陰謀得逞、將這座城市拖入絕望的深淵之前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須，將他們找出，抹除！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手......歌手？你是不是在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我找了你好久。審判官一定不知道這地方，這裡空屋子太多啦，到了晚上，可不好找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......你肯定想躲著我們。你想離我們住的地方越遠越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"找到這裡可真不容易......呼......這裡離海岸好近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這是海浪的聲音嗎？原來這麼大。還有......我聽到了呼吸聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你在這裡做什麼？你的吸氣聲音變得不大一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼......呃，你怎麼，你受了傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我流血了。快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"想走？沒那麼容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官？！難道是跟著我一路過來的......我、我沒有發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不至於讓一個普通人發現。咳，當然，即便不跟蹤你，我也一樣有辦法找到這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，是怕了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，咳咳，我承認，我一時疏忽，險些讓你逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，阿戈爾人，我一定會將你抓住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是，她已經受傷了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你確定要攔下我，保護這個危險的阿戈爾人嗎，市民？這樣的話，你會變成和她一樣的罪犯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你和其他人都不一樣。至少，你眼裡還有害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"到現在為止，你還沒有做錯事。快閃開！我也不想用劍對付你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什麼時候？你......你瞧不起我？你以為我一定沒法拿下你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我確實不是長官。可我也已經做好了準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"對付你，我會全力以赴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要出聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"放開我，你這個阿戈爾混蛋，你別以為按著我的手我就沒辦法用劍，我還有手炮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別吵。它們會發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔......另一隻手也......動不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你們聽，是不是有聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽見了......黏糊糊的東西在地上摩擦......有好多好多......好像就在外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......什麼啊？不是我們的人弄出來的，我以前從來都沒有聽過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越來越近了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"數量，在增長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼引起的？這裡的人，還是她們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"十隻——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"二十隻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"——仍在增長，仍在前進。有什麼在吸引它們爬上海岸，湧進城內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而來的方向是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"教堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？他們很興奮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你確定要像這樣撫摸這些東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你使用的詞語。他們可不是什麼“東西”。他們已經是這片大海的一部分，成為了海的子嗣，比你要純淨得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......潮汐的訊息已至。今夜又是特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一定是聞見了氣味。當有同胞加入時，他們總會變得很雀躍，很躁動，甚至想浮出海面，去陸上迎接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這很正常。我們都愛著自己的兄弟姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真當它們是你的兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不呢？在需要的時候，我也願稱陸上那些仍不得不用雙足行走的為兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不是擁有最髒污的雜種血脈，有朝一日，你也能擁有這種機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？那真是可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（觸碰海水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。今天晚上......他們好像格外有精神。或許因為有很多新老朋友都來家裡做客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你不好奇嗎？上面究竟在發生什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吵。睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"把頭塞在被子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"聽不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"看不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......好餓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"好餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"好餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是什麼鬼東西啊？！黑色的......花？還是魚？為什麼會動？好噁心，嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是......不對啊，這說不通！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"它們在拍窗！它們是不是......是不是想進來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不能讓它們進來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"把窗關緊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的，這裡的窗本來就是破的，你看上面，到處都是縫......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——伸進來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，它還在動！就這一小塊，趴在地上扭來扭去，朝我們不斷地擠過來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是那種東西......也不該這麼難纏啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了......外面還有好多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼都砍不完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我的燈......不行，燈對它們沒什麼用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......彈藥只夠再打一發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審、審判官？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"別動！待會我一開炮，你們兩個就往裡面跑。廢墟總比這破窗牢一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手在抖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"神聖的經文......將給我力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不怕它們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上出去，能殺多少是多少，應該能擋上一陣，你們要跑快一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，帶著她躲到裡面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你在說什麼啊！你沒看見嗎？我對付不了——這麼多！很快它們都會進來。屋裡和屋外沒有區別！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，離門窗越遠越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你這人根本不聽別人講話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會出去。把它們引開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你也不能出去啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是很厲害，比我見過的人都要厲害，但你受傷了呀！而且這些怪東西，可、可太多啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官也、也別出去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起躲躲？我、我知道這裡有個櫥櫃，還能關上門，就在後頭，我們三個人擠擠，應該也能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須出去。只有這樣，你們才能活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，阿戈爾人，就算要逞英雄，這裡也輪不到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好。這真的不關你的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為——它們是來找我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_04"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂推開門。\n久違的氣味自海風吹來的方向鑽入腦髓，從不屬於陸地的生物密密麻麻地填滿了街道。\n它們上下湧動著，吐息，縮緊，用行為模擬腐爛和生長，文明的疆岸在它們險惡的身軀下陷落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪物A","speakerId":"avg_npc_185","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪物B","speakerId":"avg_npc_185","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怪物C","speakerId":"avg_npc_185","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
